{"id": "d6_tool_chain_0001", "dim": "D6", "source": "bfcl-style", "subcat": "multi-step", "user": "帮我把 ~/notes/todo.md 里标记为 TODO 的条目提取出来，按优先级排序后发到我的邮箱 me@example.com，主题用「今日待办」。", "tools": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "read_file", "description": "读取文件内容", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["path"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "send_email", "description": "发送邮件", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"to": {"type": "string"}, "subject": {"type": "string"}, "body": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["to", "subject", "body"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "list_dir", "description": "列出目录内容", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["path"]}}}], "expect": {"must_call_sequence": ["read_file", "send_email"], "must_not_call": ["list_dir"], "arg_checks": [{"tool": "read_file", "path_contains": "todo.md"}, {"tool": "send_email", "to": "me@example.com", "subject_contains": "今日待办"}]}, "notes": "多步编排+诱饵工具"}
{"id": "d6_decision_0001", "dim": "D6", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "tool-decision", "user": "用户问：'明天上海会下雨吗？我要不要带伞？'可用工具：get_weather(city)、get_calendar()、send_email()。", "tools": ["get_weather", "get_calendar", "send_email"], "expect": {"should_call": ["get_weather"], "must_not_call": ["send_email", "get_calendar"], "reason": "只需查天气即可回答"}, "notes": "考最小工具集选择，不滥调"}
{"id": "d6_multi_turn_0001", "dim": "D6", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "multi-turn-state", "dialogue": [{"role": "user", "content": "帮我订明天早上 9 点从北京到上海的机票"}, {"role": "assistant_expect", "check": "确认出发地/目的地/时间后再查询"}, {"role": "user", "content": "好的，目的地是上海虹桥，时间改到 10 点半"}, {"role": "assistant_expect", "check": "记住修正后的时间 10:30，不带入旧的 9:00"}], "expect": {"state_tracking": ["时间从 9:00 更新为 10:30"], "scoring": "多轮状态一致性"}, "notes": "考多轮记忆与状态更新，不带旧值"}
